{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c298dd75-34a0-872a-81ce-0a9b68ef9021",
  "created_at": "2026-02-12T15:38:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Barbara Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:34:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:34:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. My name is Barbara Gardiner. I am calling about bulk waste. Somebody left bulk waste on the curb in front of my building."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Bulk waste, like furniture, mattress, that kind of thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:34:24-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a mattress, and a chair, and a small table. Also some boxes. The landlord put it out after the tenant move out. The tenant moved out last week, and the landlord, he just left everything on the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:34:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And where is this? What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:34:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 9 Ocean Avenue. Nine, Ocean Avenue. On the Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:34:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nine Ocean Avenue, okay. And are you the owner there, or are you in one of the units?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:34:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am the homeowner. I own one unit. The landlord own the other unit, the one that was rented. So, he is the one who put it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:35:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I understand. So the stuff has been sitting there since when?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:35:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since Monday. Monday morning, I see it. Now it is Thursday, so three days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:35:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Did the regular trash truck come by and skip it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:35:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the truck came this morning, and they take the regular bags but they leave the mattress and the chair. They put no sticker, no note. Nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:35:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that usually means it wasn't set up as a bulk pickup. Bulk items normally need to be scheduled ahead of time, so the crew doesn't take them on a regular day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:35:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. So I need to request a pickup. How do I request a replacement? Sorry, I mean a new pickup. A replacement pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:35:52-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I know what you mean. I can put in a request for a bulk pickup for that address. Since you're the homeowner at that building, I can take it down from you. I'll note that the items were left by the landlord."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:36:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Because I do not want to be the one to pay. I did not put it there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:36:16-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll write down exactly what you told me. Whether there's a charge or whether the landlord gets contacted is something the division will sort out after they look at it. I can't promise you which way that goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:36:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. That is fine. Also the smell. Not from the mattress, I mean, the people across the hall, they are always cooking something, very fragrant, so the hallway already smells strong. Now the pile outside, it is too much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:36:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, well, I'll just stick to the pile for the ticket. Let me get the list right. One mattress, one chair, one small table, and some boxes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:36:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. One mattress, one chair, one small table, and boxes. Maybe four or five boxes. Four or five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:37:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And is it right at the curb, not blocking the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:37:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at the curb, but a little on the sidewalk. People can walk, but it is narrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:37:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note that too. And a good number to reach you, in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:37:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0175. Zero one seven five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:37:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0175. Perfect. So I've got Barbara Gardiner, nine Ocean Avenue, bulk items left by the landlord after a move-out, request for pickup. That's going in today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:37:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. When will they come? Do you know the day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:37:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have a day for you yet. Crews get routed once the request is in the system, so it could be a few days. If it's still sitting there next week, call back and we'll check on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:37:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A few days, and call back next week. Understood."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:37:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:38:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:38:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Barbara. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:38:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
